      "side": 1,
      "message": "Looks good to me. I think the direction is good, though it increases discrepancy between EC-legacy and Zephyr (which will not be a problem in foreseeable future).\n\nIn future we need to work on FINGER_UP implementation on both drivers and fpsensor task side. I believe it could be improved.\n\nFYI The problem with putting sensor to sleep in `FINGER_UP` mode started in June 2018 https://chromium-review.git.corp.google.com/c/chromiumos/platform/ec/+/1125062.",
